O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"uL4jKuA41fQ-AUFBUUcrww","review_id":"ZxDZkV5pn8q799O6St8K6w","date":"2021-01-11T17:24:32","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9291471838951111,"text_excerpt":"Torshis is now located in the infamous Silk Road location on royal street. I've been dying to try this Egyptian cuisine and it didn't disappoint. Was able to buy good wine for decent price and enjoy at the table. Torshis fulfilled all my veggie dreams heart's desire. We got the deluxe hummus to start which was great. We ordered stuffed falafels but they were out :( my only complaint. I will return for those. We also got cauliflower eggplant grape leaves and spinach pies. Bread was a little lame and lifeless but everything else was to the T. The flavors were amazing and reasonably priced. My friend got the lamb entree which came with generous portion. Tables were spaced out by covid protoc..."},{"business_id":"uL4jKuA41fQ-AUFBUUcrww","review_id":"2NC5DKsCv7arj9ao-lCssQ","date":"2018-09-17T03:14:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9150292277336121,"text_excerpt":"Nice to have a new face in the St Roch market. Honestly, some of the best Middle Eastern food I've had the pleasure of eating in this city. Suck it, Mona's. All ingredients are fresh and well prepared. The hummus is smoother than my wife's bum, the eggplant dish more heavenly than my wife's bum*, the shoarma... is well seasoned. Good prices too. * My wife has a really nice bum"},{"business_id":"uL4jKuA41fQ-AUFBUUcrww","review_id":"L6tIuDyKajiau5x1iS0sdQ","date":"2018-12-17T21:43:38","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9091207981109619,"text_excerpt":"My friend and I got lunch from here on Sunday. It was excellent. I was at first drawn in by the Egyptian cat statue on the counter. It was really cool. Then the friendly man at the counter, who we figured was the owner, gave us samples of his teas and juices. We looked over the menu as we tried his samples. (They were tasty. My favorite was the Lebanese Tea.) We decided to split the Grape Leaves platter. It came with warm Pita Bread, Hummus and a choice of salad or rice. We chose the salad. It was all delicious. I am particular about Grape Leaves, and in general, I do not like most of them. These were warm and flavorful. The Hummus was outstanding. The platter portion was large and we wer..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"uL4jKuA41fQ-AUFBUUcrww","photo_id":"uoM2GdY7zw3hfiBNEh9L5Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/uoM2GdY7zw3hfiBNEh9L5Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8787133693695068},{"business_id":"uL4jKuA41fQ-AUFBUUcrww","photo_id":"m4fAK5EGOrT6H6Vl1WlhZQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/m4fAK5EGOrT6H6Vl1WlhZQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8682199120521545},{"business_id":"uL4jKuA41fQ-AUFBUUcrww","photo_id":"T8nyXbgxvw26CZ7HF1XcEw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/T8nyXbgxvw26CZ7HF1XcEw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8643264770507812},{"business_id":"uL4jKuA41fQ-AUFBUUcrww","photo_id":"-WXkN0abv8kx1z-qpZaGfg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/-WXkN0abv8kx1z-qpZaGfg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8158287405967712},{"business_id":"uL4jKuA41fQ-AUFBUUcrww","photo_id":"nYte5aCNeO1S2L4Muxgk-w","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/nYte5aCNeO1S2L4Muxgk-w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7917084097862244}]},"notebook